   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Ctrl+click (Cmd+click on a Mac) on a built-in function or a keyword, or F1 on the word at the cursor,\nopens the drawer at its entry; on a function of the program, it goes to its definition instead.",
   "originalText": "Ctrl+click (Cmd+click on a Mac) on a built-in function or a keyword, or F1 on the word at the cursor,\nopens the drawer at its entry; on a function of the program, it goes to its definition instead.",
